WEBVTT

00:13:56.430 --> 00:14:00.021
and you spot something
and your brain goes, "Oh, that's weird."

00:14:00.045 --> 00:14:03.669
And then your consciousness goes,
"You're an adult. Keep going."

00:14:03.693 --> 00:14:06.532
And that's the point --
hold that thought --

00:14:06.556 --> 00:14:09.184
that bit where your brain went,
"Oh, that's a bit odd,"

00:14:09.208 --> 00:14:11.261
because there's something
there to play with,

00:14:11.285 --> 00:14:13.003
and it's worth you playing with it,

00:14:13.027 --> 00:14:14.423
so that's the place to start.

00:14:14.447 --> 00:14:16.813
But if you don't have
any of those little moments

00:14:16.837 --> 00:14:18.433
on your way home from this event,

00:14:18.457 --> 00:14:20.142
here are some things to start with.

00:14:20.166 --> 00:14:22.328
Put raisins in [fizzy] lemonade;
highly entertaining.

00:14:22.352 --> 00:14:24.352
Watch a coffee spill dry.

00:14:24.376 --> 00:14:26.980
I know that sounds a little bit
like watching paint dry,

00:14:27.004 --> 00:14:30.469
but it does do quite weird things;
it's worth watching.